                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I liked the vibes of this game - the pixel graphics, an airship, etc. There were only 2 things I didn't like, listed below - and both are subjective, so you might like them instead.\n\nThe developers made a deliberate choice to only have a limited number of enemies in the entire game, so the amount of exp/money is also limited. As a result, later (optional) arena fights and the final boss fight on hard difficulty can feel kind of unfair - because past a certain point there is literally nothing else that you can do to prepare.\n\nThat, and story felt kind of cliche - not bad or anything, but not exactly memorable either.",
